            "On the other hand, if we took each demonstration as a kind of skill, diverse demonstrations seem to cover more alternative skills for solving target questions: even though there still exists a small portion (e.g., $1/8$) of mistakes in the demonstrations, the performance will not be negatively affected (to be shown in Figure \\ref{fig_wr}).\n",
